# ---- Unreal Engine generated / cache ----
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# ---- UnrealSharp managed build outputs ----
/Script/**/bin/
/Script/**/obj/

# ---- IDE / editor ----
.vs/
.idea/
.vsconfig
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/

# ---- Project-specific large dirs (excluded on purpose) ----
Exports/
Tools/

# ---- Extracted / derived game assets (public repo: never commit) ----
# 嘉贝莉娜攻击特效：原件（贴图、网格）、从导出数据提取的证据和配方、UE 里重建出的资产，都可以用 ArtSource/JiabeiAttack 的脚本重新生成。
/ArtSource/JiabeiAttack/Textures/
/ArtSource/JiabeiAttack/Geometry/
/ArtSource/JiabeiAttack/Evidence/
/ArtSource/JiabeiAttack/*.json
!/ArtSource/JiabeiAttack/*Tuning.json
# 角色仿鸣潮材质的配方（原作材质参数），由 ArtSource/CharacterToon/prepare_toon.py 生成。
/ArtSource/CharacterToon/*.json
# 角色卡通材质实例与导入的原作贴图（WuwaCharacterToonSetup 生成，含原作数据）。
/Content/Characters/Role/jiabei/Mesh/Toon/
/Content/Effects/Jiabei/
/Content/Effects/Models/Jiabei/

# ---- Unrelated local work (not part of Wuwa) ----
/Art/CargoClash/
/tmp/

# ---- Misc ----
*.tmp
*.log
